# Scheduler Module Rules

- Use `core/scheduler/legacy_parts/README.md` to pick the right split module before editing.
- Preserve phase order in `pipeline.py`; do not reorder A→B→C→D phases without explicit design intent.
- After edits, run `pytest -q tests/unit` and `python utils/regression_checker.py`.
- Prefer focused edits in `legacy_parts/` over expanding `constrained_scheduler.py` or `pipeline.py`.
- Preserve mandatory anchors (Reflection, Super Troop, HC/DG Tuesday) and hard constraints from BRAIN.
